00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:05.870
According to the Guinness Book of World Records, the farthest flight by a paper aircraft was

170
00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:14.190
achieved in December 2022 in Indiana by Dylan Rubel, Nathan Erickson, and Garrett Jensen.

