483
00:24:46.120 --> 00:24:51.180
Somehow, like if I brand it as an experiment, kind of like how they're saying things are opportunities.

484
00:24:51.780 --> 00:24:52.520
Opportunities, yeah.

485
00:24:53.040 --> 00:24:53.900
It is funny.

